{
  "header": [
    "T3-28 item 1 (docs/specs/T3-28.md, \"Test plan\"): a cut of the native libraries of a release APK of apps/tv, react-native-tvos 0.88.1-0, cut on 2026-11-22 at ea333f94 (origin/main).",
    "libraries: one object per lib/<abi>/*.so entry of the APK (44 entries, from unzip -Z1 app-release.apk \"lib/*\"), in the shape readLibraryFacts returns. The APK: a pnpm tv:build output of 2026-11-22 in another task worktree, sha256 2918eaa6ff085a1f010eae3726e5c362157c346e40647059ef60588b8b936d13; its lib/arm64-v8a/libreactnative.so and lib/x86_64/libreactnative.so have the sha256 of the release rows of the Facts table.",
    "The two libreactnative.so rows are read from the Gradle cache release AAR, io.github.react-native-tvos:react-android:0.88.1-0 react-android-0.88.1-0-release.aar, jni/<abi>/libreactnative.so, sha256 arm64-v8a 6094597285d555340ceb096f122cc4c172c427afbb5a6de8786fa42007e9f330, x86_64 aae53ea32f9bb338b683afcb84b8d9c9f3ac20e00c79343400e5ec578ff86d59 (checked equal to the APK entries with sha256sum).",
    "The other 42 rows are read from the APK entries themselves. Every row: sh scripts/fixtures/tv/native/cut-library.sh <entry> <file> (llvm-readelf -S -W, --dyn-syms -W and -r -W, grep -a -F, jq; symbols and relocations cut to names starting with the DISPATCHER or LOADER prefix; markers: which of \"React Native DevTools\" and \"is not implemented by this host target delegate\" the bytes hold). Only libexpo-modules-v2.so (both ABIs) has a packed relocation section (SHT_ANDROID_RELA)."
  ],
